# Admin data table pattern

Use the **admin-data-table-kit** for any admin list/table page.

## Setup

1. Include styles once on the page:
   ```blade
   <x-admin.data-table-styles />
   ```

2. Wrap content in:
   ```blade
   <div class="admin-data-table">
   ```
   (Add your layout wrapper classes outside this, e.g. `main-content`.)

3. Layout must expose `@stack('styles')` in `<head>`.

## Starter template

`resources/views/templates/admin-data-table-page-skeleton.blade.php`

## Class reference (`adt-*`)

| Area | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page header | `adt-page-header`, `adt-page-title`, `adt-page-subtitle`, `adt-btn-primary` |
| Stats row | `adt-stats`, `adt-stat`, `adt-stat-label`, `adt-stat-value` |
| Panel | `adt-panel`, `adt-toolbar`, `adt-filters`, `adt-search`, `adt-select` |
| Alerts | `adt-alert`, `adt-alert-success`, `adt-alert-error` |
| Table | `adt-table-wrap`, `adt-table`, `adt-th-sortable`, `adt-th-actions` |
| Cells | `adt-user-cell`, `adt-avatar`, `adt-user-name`, `adt-email`, `adt-tag`, `adt-muted` |
| Status | `adt-status`, `adt-status-dot`, `adt-status-active`, `adt-status-suspended`, `adt-status-inactive` |
| Actions | `adt-actions`, `adt-action-btn`, `adt-action-danger` |
| Footer | `adt-footer`, `adt-footer-count`, `adt-pagination` |
| Empty | `adt-empty`, `adt-empty-icon`, `adt-empty-title`, `adt-empty-text` |
| Modal | `adt-modal` (on `.modal-content`, outside `.admin-data-table` is OK) |

## Rules

- Neutral palette only; one primary accent (`--adt-primary`, default `#132977`).
- No colored table headers or badge-pill row actions.
- Primary CTA: `btn btn-primary btn-sm adt-btn-primary text-white`.
- Row actions: small icon buttons in `adt-action-btn`.
- Pagination: `{{ $items->links('pagination::bootstrap-5') }}` inside `adt-pagination`.
- Status: dot + label (`adt-status-active`, `adt-status-suspended`, or `adt-status-inactive`).

## Kit location

If present in repo: `admin-data-table-kit/` (portable copy for other projects).
